Local modifications: rename the division helper; use two Newton refinement
iterations under explicitly required safe Metal math. The FMA finish path
omits a normalization already established by its caller; range cases retain
d_finish. Exact remainder correction, special-case handling and final
binary64 rounding remain in the algorithms. Global binary64 helpers are
unchanged.
